BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:playmetrics-soccer--GenericCalendarEvent_2715402
DTSTAMP:20260824T002155Z
CREATED:20260724T180834Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260814T200824Z
SEQUENCE:1786738104
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261128T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261128T193000
SUMMARY:West Ham Turkey Bowl - 5v5 Freeplay Event - SG
DESCRIPTION:It’s an SLSG tradition to wrap up the Fall Season and Kick Off
 the Upper 90 Outreach Program with the TURKEY BOWL!	<br>	<br>The TURKEY BO
 WL is a one-day\, 5v5 intra-club freeplay event designed to bring our play
 ers together—uniting new teammates\, reuniting old friends\, and celebrate
  our UPPER 90 community outreach program.	<br><br>8/8 - All teams will pla
 y 2 games in a 3 hour window between 10 AM and 7:30 PM.<br>	<br>Key Detail
 s &amp\; Expectations:	<br>The Turkey Bowl is a celebration event of our U
 pper 90 Community Outreach Program\, which develops players off the field
 and positively impacts our community. We will be collecting coats\, food\,
  and used soccer gear. We will raise funds for our Holiday Adopt A Family
 Program and the Southside Brian Corona Scholarship. 	<br>	<br>Let the Game
  Be the Teacher: Coaches and team leaders are asked to step back\, handle
 substitutions\, and let the players coach themselves on the field. 	<br>	<
 br>All SLSG U6 to U12 Club Level Teams are automatically in the TURKEY BOW
 L and gall games will be played.  If teams need players\, fill out the Tea
 m Leaders &amp\; Guest Player form and tell us how many you need\, and we
 will find you players - https://bit.ly/TURKEYbowl-26-NEEDguestPLAYERSform
 <br>	<br>If you are interested in guest playing for a 2nd team in the even
 t\, please fill out this form and we will see if we can match up to a team
  needing a player.  I want to be a guest player link: https://bit.ly/TURKE
 Ybowl-IwantTOguestPLAY	<br><br>UPPER 90 ADOPT A FAMILY PROGRAM:	<br>Remind
 er that we are raising funds to buy holiday gifts for 90 soccer players fr
 om our Southside City Soccer Program. The players will receive a long-slee
 ve pullover training top\, a hat\, gloves\, and a backpack. We are also ra
 ising funds to cover the program&#39\;s operational costs. Our goal is $12
